<title>USA: Nassau County, N.Y., to sell $194 mln bond deal.</title>
<headline>Nassau County, N.Y., to sell $194 mln bond deal.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nassau County, N.Y., said Wednesday it plans to sell two issues totaling $194 million in a competitive sale July 22.</p>
<p>The deal, slated for noon EDT, includes $191.185 million general improvement bonds and $3.205 million sewer district bonds.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
